  invariant without a declared BONFYRE_MATRIX_DB the foreign verbs (observe-time promote, promote, twins, duplicates) address the first existing non-empty Matrix among $BONFYRE_STATE_ROOT/matrix.db, /var/lib/bonfyre/matrix.db and $HOME/.bonfyre/estate-local/matrix.db; a declared path always wins, an empty placeholder is skipped, and no store is created
