  preserves the actor-derived private ForeignTwin closure: receipt selection is bounded to its own receipt directory and a body is exposed only after its locally retained bytes hash to the receipt digest
  drops public promotion, external authority, distribution, and cross-actor enumeration; this is a private inspection carrier over evidence already retained
