architecture partner-commons
  canonical_name PartnerCommons
  family external
  domain External / Institutions
  layer external/relationship
  semantic_question Which external mechanism can realize a bounded Bonfyre capability without taking Bonfyre semantic ownership?
  purpose Partner Commons is a callable realization commons, not a directory: Restate carries durable progression for canonical WorkGraph lifecycle while Feldera carries incremental maintained relations. Each graft is bounded by an explicit capability contract and native receipts.
