  witness cmd/BonfyreWebAddress/tests/gym_test.sh
  measured 8 of 41 lawful equivalences closed before internalization, 41 of 41 after, 0 false merges throughout
  known_gap http and https remain unfolded; closing them requires digest agreement and therefore an outbound fetch, which is a rate-aware act rather than a resolution-time one
  invariant an observation is admissible only when the bytes are the kind of thing that was requested; permission and transport succeeding is not the resource answering, and four sitemap requests answered 200 with one shared bot-wall page were admissible under a law that never asked
  invariant the boundary test is a type contradiction and never a judgement about prose; a request for a structured format answered with an HTML document is checked, and no page is classified by whether it reads like an error, because a document may lawfully discuss errors
  invariant a ceiling that falls because a defect was found is the correct direction; the number was overstated, and correcting it downward is the measurement working rather than a regression
  forbidden_inference a 200 -> an answer
  forbidden_inference a body that is not a boundary -> a body that is correct, current or complete
