  invariant collected is a read-only SourceFrontier operation over an exact collection and video identity; the browser supplies no database or filesystem location and the operation makes no remote request
  invariant retained observations, source transcripts and source receipts enter the same workbench, CMS draft projection and held-work envelope; the bridge adds no second host or source store
  forbidden_inference retained transcript or caption -> a complete recipe, verified nutritional values, current availability or media rights
  source_path integrations/browser/extension/store.mjs
