  preserves the page's address, the capture identity, and each representation's hash and size
  drops the representations themselves from the reply; they stay on disk under the foreign root and the browser receives references
  forbidden_inference a capture asked for from the panel -> the page as the reader was seeing it; a separate browser read it with no session
